# vfates SSH workers. One worker per line.
#
#   host              hardware_class      gpus
#
# host is a hostname or user@host. hardware_class matches configs/program.yaml.
# gpus is the count this machine claims (1, 2, or 4). The queue path passed to
# scripts/queue/ssh_workers.sh must be visible at that same path on every host.
#
# gpu01.example.edu   rtx-a6000-48gb      1
# gpu02.example.edu   rtx-5000-ada-32gb   1
# gpu03.example.edu   a100-80gb           1
# gpu04.example.edu   h100-80gb           4
